  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Obtain a new <a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "获取一个新的<a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.callback 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "On <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#subscribe()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>subscribe</code></a> invoke the matching <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>entity callbacks</code></a> with given\narguments.",
      "translation": "在调用带有给定参数的匹配<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#subscribe()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>subscribe</code></a>时，会触发相应的<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>实体回调</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the given <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callback</code></a> using generic type argument detection for identification of supported\ntypes.",
      "translation": "使用泛型类型参数检测来添加给定的<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callback</code></a>，以识别支持的类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if a required argument is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 当必需参数为 null 时抛出。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callbacks</code></a> are pre-loaded from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>. <br/>\nUse <a href=\"#addEntityCallback(org.springframework.data.mapping.callback.EntityCallback)\"><code>addEntityCallback(EntityCallback)</code></a> to register additional callbacks manually.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callbacks</code></a> 会从给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中预加载。  \n可以使用 <a href=\"#addEntityCallback(org.springframework.data.mapping.callback.EntityCallback)\"><code>addEntityCallback(EntityCallback)</code></a> 手动注册额外的回调。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a> instance with given <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callbacks</code></a>. <br/>\nThe provided <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callbacks</code></a> are immediately <a href=\"#addEntityCallback(org.springframework.data.mapping.callback.EntityCallback)\"><code>added</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.callback 中的接口\"><code>callbacks</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.callback 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a>实例。<br/>\n提供的<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.callback 中的接口\"><code>callbacks</code></a>会立即被<a href=\"#addEntityCallback(org.springframework.data.mapping.callback.EntityCallback)\"><code>添加</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a new <a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a> instance. <br/>\nUse <a href=\"#addEntityCallback(org.springframework.data.mapping.callback.EntityCallback)\"><code>addEntityCallback(EntityCallback)</code></a> to register callbacks manually.",
      "translation": "获取一个新的<a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.callback 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a>实例。<br/>使用<a href=\"#addEntityCallback(org.springframework.data.mapping.callback.EntityCallback)\"><code>addEntityCallback(EntityCallback)</code></a>手动注册回调。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a> instance with given <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callbacks</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.callback 中的接口\"><code>callbacks</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"ReactiveEntityCallbacks.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.callback 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveEntityCallbacks</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Interface to be implemented by objects that can manage a number of <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> objects and invoke these\nwith a specific entity.",
      "translation": "由能够管理多个<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> 对象并针对特定实体调用这些对象的接口。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if the required argument is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果所需的参数为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"callback(java.lang.Class,T,java.lang.Object...)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - Entity type.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"callback(java.lang.Class,T,java.lang.Object...)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 实体类型。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting the result after invoking the callbacks.",
      "translation": "一个在调用回调后发出结果的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
